WEBVTT

00:03:56.983 --> 00:04:01.779
Actually, those two seemed like
they were very often, even constantly ...

00:04:01.821 --> 00:04:03.531
(Laughter)

00:04:03.572 --> 00:04:04.949
... having fun together.

00:04:05.616 --> 00:04:08.202
(Laughter)

00:04:08.244 --> 00:04:10.204
And as you can see in these photographs,

00:04:10.204 --> 00:04:14.041
true fun produces this visceral sense
of lightness and joy.

00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:16.168
It's radiant.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:19.463
In fact, when I asked my daughter,
when she was about five years old,

00:04:19.505 --> 00:04:21.257
what color fun would be,

00:04:21.257 --> 00:04:22.717
she said "sunshine."

00:04:24.885 --> 00:04:26.429
So what is this sunshine?

00:04:26.429 --> 00:04:28.764
You know? What is this feeling
that we call "fun"?

00:04:28.806 --> 00:04:30.933
When people tell me
their stories about fun,